Stream a finalized inventory snapshot, including coverage, to JSON or JSONL

Usage: aws-inventory export [OPTIONS] --scan-id <SCAN_ID> --output <OUTPUT>

Options:
      --db <DB>                  [default: inventory.sqlite]
      --scan-id <SCAN_ID>        
      --output <OUTPUT>          
      --format <FORMAT>          [default: jsonl] [possible values: json, jsonl]
      --provenance <PROVENANCE>  [default: normalized] [possible values: normalized, all-observations]
      --allow-partial            
  -h, --help                     Print help
